ash does not see eye to eye with all  of the other operators  thatcher and her come from opposing  sides of the fence and from the military  and her from the police she has strong  left-leaning views of the world  such as freedom equality reform and  internationalism  while he aligned strongly with the  notions such as authority  hierarchy order duty and nationalism  both are very passionate people who  firmly believed in their organizations  and if these two managed to get into a  heated discussion and emotions were  running high  it could very easily become an extremely  volatile and intense situation  clash uses a crowd control electroshield  as your primary weapon  this bulletproof extendable shield is  able to slow down opponents by using a  high voltage charge field generator that  spreads out  directly in front of the shield hostiles  caught in the charge field generator  also sustain a small amount of damage  over time  [Music]  using the shield clash is effective at  blocking entry points  or slowing down a push from the opposing  force  clash's story shows the struggle she  faced on one side of the fence  yet with almost identical problems when  she joined up with what she would have  considered  the enemy when she was younger one of  those tough hardened woman that even i  as a six foot four man would be  concerned about bumping into on the  wrong day  once again i need to thank drenius a  long long-standing community  member on discord for helping me out  with the gameplay footage on yet another  siege video  he never asks for anything in return he  just does it for the love of games  in turn hoping for content like this to  only assist in building interest around  these titles  also he's a bloody nice guy to top it  off if you see him on discord give him a  virtual high five or  elbow bump or whatever you guys than  lockdown are allowed to do  thank you very much for watching and  i'll catch in the next one cheers  you

